"V, Diode.Ron, [Diode.RR.IF Diode.RR.didt Diode.RR.Irrm Diode.RR.trr Diode.RR."
"Qrr Diode.RR.Tmeas Diode.RR.ktau], Diode.Cj.V, Diode.Cj.C, Diode.nPara, [Diod"
"e.Aval.Vbr Diode.Aval.Rav]"
